<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell one point to 1,265.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell one point to 1,265.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,265 today from 1,266 on June 13, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1340    12.169	  1334    12.113</p>
<p>   1a   1269  9613.000	  1265  9581.000</p>
<p>   2    1496    21.375	  1494    21.344</p>
